    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31459" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nundĭnārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a market</i> or <i>fair, market-</i> (postAug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 51, 77, § 208</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oppidum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 17, 40, § 80</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epulae,</span>”
				<i>given to those who attended the market</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					17, 2, 69</span></i>
			.</div>
